            "content": "<p><strong>Fast shipping. No-fuss returns.</strong></p><p>We ship quickly because waiting sucks.</p><ul><li>Orders usually ship within 48 hours (excluding Sundays and lazy cats).</li><li>Delivery time: 3–7 business days, depending on where you are.</li><li>Got an issue? We have a 7-day return window. Just keep it unused and in original packaging.</li><li>Custom-made items? Those are made just for you, so they can’t be returned unless there’s a legit defect.</li></ul><p>No long forms, no fake promises — just smooth service.</p>",
